# Roadmap

> Status: Skeleton. Definitive roadmap from the master task.

## Master Roadmap

```
Prototype v0.0.1 -> Validation -> Funding -> Commercial MVP
  -> Certification + Talent + Recruitment
```

## Milestones

### M00 - Project Foundation (CURRENT)

Clean, reproducible technical foundation:

- Repository structure: `frontend/`, `backend/`, `docs/`.
- Next.js + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS frontend.
- Python + FastAPI backend.
- PostgreSQL + SQLAlchemy + migration-ready setup.
- Docker Compose for frontend / backend / postgres.
- `/api/health` returning `{"status":"ok"}`.
- `.env.example` and secure `.gitignore`.
- Root README with only currently implemented capabilities.
- Initial documentation skeletons.
- Git-friendly structure and local development instructions.

Out of scope for M00: home page, navbar, auth, dashboards, courses, lessons,
assessments, payments, certification, recruitment, AI, sandbox, microservices,
Kubernetes.

### M01 - (Recommended next milestone, NOT started)

Likely: minimal frontend shell and user-facing bilingual home page wired to the
backend. This is a recommendation only and is not executed as part of M00.

### Future Milestones

Validation, funding, commercial MVP, certification, talent, recruitment. Detailed
definitions will be written when each milestone is scheduled.
